  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5602.04 Person Requesting their Own Record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5602.04 Person Requesting their Own Record.\n\n(a) A person who is requesting his/her own information shall complete form DSMV 505, by providing his or her name, address, date of birth, and specifying what information s/he wants to receive by checking the appropriate box.\n\n(b) The person requesting his or her own motor vehicle record shall execute DSMV 505 under penalties of unsworn falsification.\n\n(c) In addition to a properly completed DSMV 505, the person shall provide proof of identity if requesting information in person.\n\nSource. #6403, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-97; rpld and ss by #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
